WEBVTT

00:16:57.914 --> 00:17:02.785
along comes a demon, a dragon,
a downsizing, a pandemic.

00:17:03.653 --> 00:17:07.189
Just when our fairy tale
seems poised to come true,

00:17:07.223 --> 00:17:10.893
a wolf shows up
and threatens to destroy it.

00:17:12.228 --> 00:17:13.529
And that's OK.

00:17:14.297 --> 00:17:17.900
Because if you banish the wolf,
you banish the hero.

00:17:19.035 --> 00:17:20.736
And if there's one thing I learned,

00:17:20.736 --> 00:17:24.006
we all need to be the hero
of our own story.

00:17:25.074 --> 00:17:27.743
That's why we have fairy tales, after all.

00:17:28.144 --> 00:17:31.447
And why we tell them year after year,